e application fee: Rs.25/- will have to be paid.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 183.541%\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UPSSSC Advt No : <b>06-Exam/2026 </b>Notification Before Apply Online</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 183.541%\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 53.2369%\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"392\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 130.304%\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"391\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 183.541%\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"783\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>For Online Answer key Objection Link</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Answer Key Objection Link\" href=\"https://technical-assistant-group-c-main-exam-09082026.answer-objections.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Question paper with Answer Key</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Answer Key Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"7\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UPSSSC AGTA Answer Key Not